  "details": "So on a stream I was talking to a person that thought it to be a good idea for VRchat to implement a way for someone to save a fullbody calibration for a specific avatar. Like have a quick button saying 'Save Calibration' and another saying 'Reset Calibration'. That way you'll never need to be taken out of a moment in order to be the avatar you want. Honestly I'd love this because some avatars need minor adjustments with my real body in order for it to work the way I want.\n\nPlus with this, you wont really need a mirror or to get back up if you may be sitting down after a long day. You could just load into an avatar you have a calibration already set for. Of course if you load into a new avatar, you'll need to save a new calibration.",
